<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
<p>10/01/2008		1,205M    4.75  %</p>
<p>							  (Super Sinker)</p>
<p>10/01/2009		1,590M    5.10  %</p>
<p>							  (Super Sinker)</p>
<p>10/01/2010		  555M    5.30  %</p>
<p>							  (Super Sinker)</p>
<p>SUPER SINKERS:  THE SUPERSINKER BONDS WILL BE SUBJECT TO REDEMPTION PRIOR TO THEIR STATED MATURITY, ACCORDING TO THE AVAILABLITY OF EXCESS REVENUES GENERATED FROM INTEREST EARNINGS ON THE AUTHORITY'S MONTHLY LEASE RENTAL STREAM.</p>
<p>AND THE DEBT SERVICES RESERVE FUND. BASED ON AN ASSUMED EARNINGS INVESTMENT RATE OF 4.50%, THE AUTHORITY EXPECTS THE AVERAGE LIVES ON THE SUPERSINKERS TO TO BE AS FOLLOWS:</p>
<p>STATED MATURITY*  (OCTOBER 1) AMOUNT*  ESTIMATED AVERAGE LIFE*</p>
